{"about":["System Shock is the fully fledged remake of the ground breaking original from 1994, combining cult gameplay with all-new HD visuals, updated controls, an overhauled interface and all-new sounds & music; it even has the original voice actor of SHODAN, one of gaming’s most iconic villains. Witness the rebirth of one of the greatest and most influential games ever created.","A first-person fight to the death in the depths of space!","SHE IS SELF-AWARE AND AWARE OF YOU","Meet SHODAN: The psychotic AI has taken control of Citadel Station and turned the crew into an army of cyborgs and mutants; She now plans to do the same to Earth. You must explore and battle your way through the depths of a space station gone to hell. Stop SHODAN and avert humanity’s destruction.","HER TERMINATION IS OUR SALVATION","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense)."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/f6acbcf65fdfcf7fc2e30e16fc180ac8aca26c17daed03b1.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/f6acbcf65fdfcf7fc2e30e16fc180ac8aca26c17daed03b1.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/8e5f8ed0aa4ce13e5286abbeebdc833848ba7cce0175837e.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/8e5f8ed0aa4ce13e5286abbeebdc833848ba7cce0175837e.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/f6e859a120a9d9fab5f60de1230beae2caa4b4988f7b3aad.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/f6e859a120a9d9fab5f60de1230beae2caa4b4988f7b3aad.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202403/0417/ac5a65ec94619530363a5fb799cec5f690d82f00f8087c0e.jpg?w=1920&thu